  id: l1_wiring
  title: Sticker on the fuse box
  body: 'STORM RULE


    Anything that feeds the TOWER stays DOWN.

    Everything else UP.


    (The breaker labels burned off in the ''09 fire. The circuit diagram is pinned up in the manager''s office.)


    Insert the main fuse first, then pull the main lever.'
